<p>
<strong>
T"This article contains CWs for:"
</strong>
T" drug use, suicide, and homophobic slurs."
</p>
<p>
T"SCP-102: Property of Marshall, Carter, and Dark Ltd. by "
<span class="printuser avatarhover">
<a href="/user:info/xexnoncores" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(0); return false;">
